.Dd August 21, 2026
.Dt WGET 1
.Os sbase
.Sh NAME
.Nm wget
.Nd fetch a file over http or https
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl C Ar cacert
.Op Fl O Ar file
.Ar url
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
requests
.Ar url ,
which must use the http or https scheme, and writes the response body
to standard output.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl C Ar cacert
Use the PEM bundle
.Ar cacert
to validate the server certificate instead of the default
.Pa /etc/ssl/cert.pem .
.It Fl O Ar file
Write the body to
.Ar file
instead of standard output.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits 0 if the server answered with a 2xx status and the body was
written completely, 1 otherwise.
